;translated profiles for character without dialogue (move to their dialogue file when it gets added)
@CHARA_INFO_HEADER(ARG)
CALL CHARA_TEXT(ARG, nameArray:ARG:na_Title)
PRINTL

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K3_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[カナ]])
PRINTFORML A poltergeist who is currently haunting the Hakurei Shrine.
PRINTFORML She used to live at a large western mansion, but as its owner grew used to her and stopped paying attention, she decided to move elsewhere.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Thinks of herself as the only normal person in a world of weirdos, but in truth is quite weird herself.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K8_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[ちゆり]])
PRINTFORML A fifteen-year old researcher who works for the professor on board the Probability Space Hypervessel.
PRINTFORML Since education is vastly accelerated in her world, she received her graduate degree in comparative physics at age thirteen,
PRINTFORML and has been working with Yumemi ever since, choosing to follow her into Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORM As an assistant, her main duties are to organize the research data and to keep Yumemi's more 
FONTITALIC
PRINTFORM eccentric
FONTREGULAR
PRINTFORML  qualities in check,
PRINTFORML but due to her own immaturity, usually just ends up making the situation worse.
IF !RAND:100
	PRINTFORML
	SETCOLOR C_RED
	FONTSTYLE 4
	PRINTFORM Occasional rumors spread that there's a second Chiyuri who can use magic, however
	SETCOLOR C_YELLOW
	FONTREGULAR
	PRINTFORML  This statement redacted by authority of the Parallel Police.
	RESETCOLOR
ENDIF
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K45_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[理香子]])
PRINTFORML A magic-user from Gensokyo typically holed up in her laboratory.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Despite being an accomplished magician, she cares little for magic, and instead pursues scientific discovery instead.
PRINTFORML Her extremist mindset make her an outlier within Gensokyo, and she's considered a heretic by many.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K46_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[明羅]])
PRINTFORML A samurai wandering Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Determined to obtain the power of the Hakurei for herself, she eagerly trains herself to gain the strength to overcome the shrine maiden.
PRINTFORML While generally presenting herself as confident and driven, she feels somewhat insecure about her femininity
PRINTFORML , and occasionally worries about being mistaken for a man.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K47_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[里香]])
PRINTFORML A tank engineer with a workshop hidden in a remote area of Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML For unknown reasons, she once attacked the Hakurei Shrine with her tanks and an army of ghosts she created,
PRINTFORML but she has kept quiet ever since.
PRINTFORML Relying entirely on her machines, her own fighting abilities are rather lacking, generally avoiding conflict.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K48_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[ルイズ]])
PRINTFORML An inhabitant of Makai.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML She enjoys visiting new places and meeting new people, and can occasionally be seen in Gensokyo.
PRINTFORML However, she doesn't have much of a presence of her own, and people hardly take notice of her.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K102_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[神綺]])
PRINTFORML God and ruler of Makai.
PRINTFORML Responsible for the creation of Makai and all its inhabitants, but does not appear to have much control over them.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Currently staying over at Alice's home along with Yumeko.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K114_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[くるみ]])
PRINTFORML A vampire girl who was once a gatekeeper at the lake in the mountains behind the Hakurei Shrine.
PRINTFORML However, it's not entirely clear whether she is truly a vampire, or just a youkai who sucks blood.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Currently, she lives with the owner of Mugenkan, who moved the entire building to the Garden of the Sun.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K115_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[エリー]])
PRINTFORML A girl wielding a signature scythe who used to serve as a gatekeeper at Mugenkan.
PRINTFORML Due to Kurumi's excellence at her job, she hadn't had much opportunity of having an actual fight, so her skills seemed to have dulled.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Currently, she lives with the owner of Mugenkan, who moved the entire building to the Garden of the Sun.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K116_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[夢月]])
PRINTFORML With her older sister, Gengetsu, she is the owner of the (Unnamed) Dream World. Together they are one person.
PRINTFORML She's dressed as a maid, but she's hardly a servant.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML She has a lot of experience in dating, but it seems that she never went beyond the line yet in her relationships.
PRINTFORML She is steadfast and has great composure and confidence.
PRINTFORML This makes it difficult to have a quick intimate relationship with her,
PRINTFORML but it also means that as long as you are sincere, you will not be betrayed.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K145_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[小兎姫]])
PRINTFORML A supposed Gensokyo police officer and a self-proclaimed princess.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Legend has it that she abducted and imprisoned the red-white Shrine Maiden herself, which may or may not be true.
PRINTFORML A known recluse and a collector of things. She's got a few screws loose, enough so that even other weirdos tend to stay away from her.
PRINTFORML Although she lived in the village, no one had seen her for ages until one day she decided to wake up and get back to work again.
PRINTFORML There's a strange aura and power emanating from her, even though she appears to be human.
RETURN 1
		
@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K146_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[エリス]])
PRINTFORML A devil of some kind with large purple wings and a wand who arrived from Makai. Said to be able to turn into a bat.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML She has a cocky attitude, but is keen on sex, given the skills and experience she possesses.
PRINTFORML Declares herself a devil of the night, but poses no real threat.
PRINTFORML Her curiosity about her new environment and the humans who inhabit it should make it relatively easy to get close to her.
PRINTFORML Has no affiliation with vampires, but seems somehow connected to Sariel, whom she greatly admires...
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K147_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[サリエル]])
PRINTFORML A figure said to be an angel of death who arrived from Makai.
PRINTFORML She's quite ancient and seems to be well-versed in many ways in addition to her being quite approachable.
PRINTFORML However, her physical presence is rather faint, resulting in her being much more delicate than the rest.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K148_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[サラ]])
PRINTFORML A guardian of the gateway into Makai. Now that it's closed, she's left out of job for the moment.
PRINTFORML She's good friends not only with her fellow Makai residents (past and present),
PRINTFORML but also with SDM's gatekeeper, perhaps because they share (or used to share) the same line of work.
PRINTFORML She's relatively chaste for a Makai, having barely played with herself at night.
PRINTFORML But her inexperience makes it difficult for her to handle new relationships.
PRINTFORML That said, perhaps her many friends could convince her to give you a chance?
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K149_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[オレンジ]])
PRINTFORML A small-time youkai who holds an object that looks like a majorette.
PRINTFORML Incidentally, "Orange" may not even be her real name, but no one cared enough to remember.
PRINTFORML A gentle person to begin with, a series of unfortunate events have made her feel even more insecure about herself.
PRINTFORML 
PRINTFORML Her exposed midriff and shorts may have given you the wrong impression, but in fact she's a very pure girl,
PRINTFORML even though she's a weakling and a coward who can easily be coerced.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML She's aware of the rumor of her resemblance to a certain famous gatekeeper.
PRINTFORML While she respects her, she doesn't like being overshadowed by someone far superior to her.
PRINTFORML Her goal is to become stronger and to establish herself as her own person.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Her hair turns blue when in distress.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K150_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[コンガラ]])
PRINTFORML A swordswoman from Hell with bright red eyes and a horn sprouting from her forehead. Also known as the Astral Knight.
PRINTFORML Named after Konngara Douji, an attendant of the Wisdom King Acala, or Fudoo Myouou.
PRINTFORML She's the seventh of the Eight Great Youths, and is considered a type of Buddha.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML Her true sex is unknown, and her androgynous form makes it even harder to tell, but she seems to prefer the female aspect.
PRINTFORML Given her horn and location, she may have been affiliated with the Oni, perhaps even as one of the Big Four, but she refuses to elaborate.
PRINTFORML Still, she seems to treat the other members quite well.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML One thing is certain, however, and that is her overwhelming power.
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K152_0
CALL CHARA_INFO_HEADER([[キクリ]])
PRINTFORML A goddess from Hell who lives inside a bronze disc.
PRINTFORML In ancient Japan, bronze mirrors were used as ritual objects in Buddhism and Shinto, where they were believed to represent or be
PRINTFORML inhabited by gods.
PRINTFORML Judging by her name, she might actually be Kikurihime, the Japanese goddess of love, marriage, and negotiation.
PRINTFORML If you befriend her, maybe she'll help you win the heart of the girl you like. Or maybe she'll win yours...
RETURN 1

@CHARA_INFO_KOJO_K158()
TRYCALL M_KOJO_COLOR_K158
PRINTFORML %nameArray:158:na_Title%
RESETCOLOR
PRINTL 
PRINTFORML A vengeful spirit with a grudge against Gensokyo and %CALLNAME:1% in particular.
PRINTFORML %HE_SHE(TARGET,1)% escaped from Former Hell, and can possess humans and youkai alike. When %HE_SHE(TARGET)% possess youkai, %HE_SHE(TARGET)% drains their magical power until they fall into comas.
PRINTFORML %HIS_HER(TARGET,1)% family used to take care of the Hakurei Shrine long, long ago, before Gensokyo even existed.
PRINTFORML It's still not clear just who %HE_SHE(TARGET)% is, why %HE_SHE(TARGET)% hates %CALLNAME:1% so much, or why %HES_SHES(TARGET)% going around in %HIS_HER(TARGET)% spirit form instead of possessing a body...
PRINTFORML But maybe %HE_SHE(TARGET)%'ll tell you if you manage to befriend %HIM_HER(TARGET)%.
RETURN 1
